This mirror
-----------

Maintainer of this GitHub repository: *not the author.*

This mirror exists to make the v1.0.22 source available and buildable on modern
kernels. Changes made in this mirror, as distinct from upstream, are:

  * `name.c`, `namei.c` — replaced `strncpy()` with `memcpy_and_pad()`.
    `strncpy` has been removed from `include/linux/string.h` in recent kernels;
    the old call also over-read the source by up to 7 bytes, since the length
    argument was rounded up to a multiple of 8 past the end of the name.
  * `name.c` — `#include <string.h>` changed to `#include <linux/string.h>`.
  * `linux-compat.h` — added a `memcpy_and_pad()` shim for kernels < 5.9.
  * `.gitignore` — root-anchored `/mkspadfs` and `/spadfsck` so the ignore
    rules match the built binaries and not the source directories.
  * `DESIGN-ANALYSIS.md` — third-party critical analysis, not upstream
    documentation.
  * `AGENTS.md` — contributor/agent guidelines for working in this mirror.
  * `CREDITS` — this file.

If you have questions about SpadFS itself, its design intent, or its licensing,
please direct them to the author rather than to the maintainer of this mirror.


